    },
    {
      "unit_id": 9,
      "text": "8　整机的标志、包装和运输\n附录Ａ(资料性)　试验线路人工伤损布局和尺寸犌犅／犜28426-2021前　　言本文件按照ＧＢ／Ｔ1.1-2020《标准化工作导则　第1部分：标准化文件的结构和起草规则》的规定起草.本文件代替ＧＢ／Ｔ28426-2012《大型超声波钢轨探伤车》，与ＧＢ／Ｔ28426-2012相比，除编辑性ａ)　更改了术语“钢轨探伤车”的定义(见3.1，2012年版的3.1)；\nｂ)　删除了“人工伤损检出”“伤损误报”的术语和定义(见2012年版的3.2、3.3)；\nｃ)　增加了“回波图形”“检出”“固定回波”“误报”的术语和定义(见3.2、3.3、3.4、3.5)；\nｄ)　更改了环境和线路等使用条件(见4.1、4.2，2012年版的4.1、4.2)；\nｅ)　更改了整车最高自运行速度、最高探伤检测速度等技术要求(见5.1，2012年版的4.3、5.1)；\nｆ)　更改了动力传动系统的备用系统、燃油箱容量等技术要求(见5.2.1，2012年版的5.2)；\nｇ)　更改了走行系统中转向架、车轴齿轮箱和制动装置的技术要求(见5.2.2，2012年版的5.5)；\nｈ)　更改了液压系统连续作业后的油温要求、气动系统设置外供取风接口的要求(见5.2.3，2012年版的5.9)；\nｉ)　更改了空气制动系统采用的制动机的性能要求(见5.2.4，2012年版的5.6)；\nｊ)　更改了电气系统安装和布线、电磁兼容等技术要求(见5.2.5，2012年版的5.7)；\nｋ)　更改了车体主车架重要焊缝无损探伤的要求(见5.2.6，2012年版的5.3、5.4)；\nｌ)　更改了司机室与探伤操作室的噪声相关要求(见5.2.7，2012年版的5.4)；\nｍ)　更改了车钩缓冲装置的组装要求、车钩中心距轨面高度等要求(见5.2.8，2012年版的5.3)；\nｎ)　更改了照明装置的设置位置和照度值的要求(见5.2.9，2012年版的5.8)；\nｏ)　更改了供水装置的分类、防锈蚀等技术要求(见5.2.10，2012年版的5.10)；\nｐ)　更改了探头支承机构的安全要求和耦合水、轮缘水喷洒功能要求(见5.3.1，2012年版的5.11.2)；\nｑ)　增加了探头对中系统(见5.3.2)、安全报警装置(见5.4)；\nｒ)　更改了超声检测系统的平均伤损误报率等技术要求(见5.3.3，2012年版的5.11.3)；\nｓ)　删除了超声波换能器要求(见2012年版的5.11.1)；\nｔ)　更改了运行性能试验、作业性能试验的检查与试验方法(见第6章，2012年版的第6章)；\nｕ)　更改了整车、部件性能和作业性能的检验规则(见第7章，2012年版的第7章).\n请注意本文件的某些内容可能涉及专利.本文件的发布机构不承担识别专利的责任.\n本文件由国家铁路局归口.\n及化学研究所、宝鸡中车时代工程机械有限公司.\n骆海波、朱红军、李红梁.\n---2012年首次发布为ＧＢ／Ｔ28426-2012；\n---本次为第一次修订.\nⅠ犌犅／犜28426-2021",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e9a19473617fe63bc8bae991b0d3f322",
      "num_prefix": "8",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 10,
      "text": "1　范围\n运输.本文件适用于在1435ｍｍ轨距铁路上使用的采用超声波技术钢轨探伤车(以下简称“探伤车”)的设计、制造和检验.非标准轨距铁路的探伤车可参照执行.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:48f3386a14d4c267b920f05faa9118ce",
      "num_prefix": "1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 11,
      "text": "2　规范性引用文件\n下列文件中的内容通过文中的规范性引用而构成本文件必不可少的条款.其中，注日期的引用文件，仅该日期对应的版本适用于本文件；不注日期的引用文件，其最新版本(包括所有的修改单)适用于本文件.\nＧＢ／Ｔ17426　铁道特种车辆和轨行机械动力学性能　评定及试验方法ＧＢ／Ｔ25336-2018　铁路大型养路机械　检查与试验方法ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018　铁路大型养路机械　通用技术条件",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:2d0064e7080cb66b80777a386e40288f",
      "num_prefix": "2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 12,
      "text": "3　术语和定义\n下列术语和定义适用于本文件.\n3.1钢轨探伤车　狉犪犻犾犳犾犪狑犱犲狋犲犮狋犻狅狀狏犲犺犻犮犾犲安装有钢轨探伤装置，能在运行中检测和记录钢轨缺陷的大型养路机械.\n3.2回波图形　狌犾狋狉犪狊狅狌狀犱犲犮犺狅犅＿狊犮犪狀狆犪狋狋犲狉狀超声反射回波形成的Ｂ型图形显示.\n3.3检出　犱犲狋犲犮狋犻狅狀人工伤损或自然伤损被识别.\n3.4固定回波　犳犻狓犲犱狌犾狋狉犪狊狅狌狀犱犲犮犺狅犅＿狊犮犪狀狆犪狋狋犲狉狀在试验线路某一位置可重复出现的非人工伤损回波图形.\n3.5误报　犳犪犾狊犲犪犾犪狉犿识别的非人工伤损或非自然伤损回波图形，固定回波除外.\n3.6人工伤损检出率　犱犲狋犲犮狋犻狅狀狉犪狋犲对试验线路的一次检测中，人工伤损检出数量与实际设置的人工伤损数量的比率.\n3.7伤损误报率　犳犪犾狊犲犪犾犪狉犿狉犪狋犲对试验线路的一次检测中，误报数量与实际设置的人工伤损数量的比率.\n犌犅／犜28426-20213.8平均人工伤损检出率　犪狏犲狉犪犵犲犱犲狋犲犮狋犻狅狀狉犪狋犲对试验线路进行多次检测，人工伤损检出率的平均值.\n3.9平均伤损误报率　犪狏犲狉犪犵犲犳犪犾狊犲犪犾犪狉犿狉犪狋犲对试验线路进行多次检测，伤损误报率的平均值.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:013d69cf9ef566b25e7646e213091b9f",
      "num_prefix": "3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 13,
      "text": "4　使用条件",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:670dab82fb1079f581a4d5bcda22a044",
      "num_prefix": "4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 14,
      "text": "4.1　环境条件",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 13,
      "unit_hash": "md5:c00a5425e1fcdc029fe4e2848950e952",
      "num_prefix": "4.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 15,
      "text": "4.1.1　环境温度：-15℃～＋50℃，低温地区要求-25℃～＋50℃.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 14,
      "unit_hash": "md5:c0b9f477174c88054c4f53617a0cb3ff",
      "num_prefix": "4.1.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 16,
      "text": "4.1.2　海拔2500ｍ及以下，高海拔地区要求海拔5100ｍ及以下.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 14,
      "unit_hash": "md5:a86b4bc610a86a5daa0e6f8a05c44395",
      "num_prefix": "4.1.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 17,
      "text": "4.1.3　相对湿度应不大于95％(月平均最低气温25℃).",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 14,
      "unit_hash": "md5:8761d74bce78d9ab213af9dfb11666e6",
      "num_prefix": "4.1.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 18,
      "text": "4.1.4　有风、沙、雨、雪天气.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 14,
      "unit_hash": "md5:3118cddbcce6cccfb35d3af7f35725f6",
      "num_prefix": "4.1.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 19,
      "text": "4.1.5　应能满足昼夜作业的要求.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 14,
      "unit_hash": "md5:5a929d62185b52c27d78dc4f02a5a088",
      "num_prefix": "4.1.5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 20,
      "text": "4.2　线路条件",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 13,
      "unit_hash": "md5:7f2da6ff2fde31ceefe20b8995d61366",
      "num_prefix": "4.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 21,
      "text": "4.2.1　线路最大超高：180ｍｍ.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 20,
      "unit_hash": "md5:35a34c6672a4a83a0cf4de132627f0dc",
      "num_prefix": "4.2.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 22,
      "text": "4.2.2　线路最大坡度：33‰.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 20,
      "unit_hash": "md5:23bfa4c6108acd04be4f7b6605087edd",
      "num_prefix": "4.2.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 23,
      "text": "4.2.3　最小通过曲线半径：180ｍ.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 20,
      "unit_hash": "md5:756d054f65b22069b7d9e2dc65ca150b",
      "num_prefix": "4.2.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 24,
      "text": "4.2.4　最小作业曲线半径：250ｍ.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 20,
      "unit_hash": "md5:53c7716248ac78cf6a7dcd917ff26348",
      "num_prefix": "4.2.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 25,
      "text": "5　技术要求",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:5b234eda273226275733fad67e418de0",
      "num_prefix": "5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 26,
      "text": "5.1　整车要求",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 25,
      "unit_hash": "md5:0e6e5b9d6993a654511e323bff31eff4",
      "num_prefix": "5.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 27,
      "text": "5.1.1　符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中5.1～5.18、5.22、5.23的规定.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 26,
      "unit_hash": "md5:243f5d5dcca36b0c0cf5b49b46b39731",
      "num_prefix": "5.1.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 28,
      "text": "5.1.2　最高自运行速度和最大附挂速度不应小于120ｋｍ／ｈ.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 26,
      "unit_hash": "md5:8507a0dfaf81de584ff10299cf70e7a0",
      "num_prefix": "5.1.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 29,
      "text": "5.1.3　平直线路上最高探伤检测速度不应小于60ｋｍ／ｈ.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 26,
      "unit_hash": "md5:6ed87ec99dec0bf99010334b69d5ea90",
      "num_prefix": "5.1.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 30,
      "text": "5.1.4　整车动力学性能应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ17426的规定.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 26,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e07b27f9ac806fb0cabed56d705f85a4",
      "num_prefix": "5.1.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 31,
      "text": "5.1.5　满足50ｋｇ／ｍ～75ｋｇ／ｍ在役钢轨探伤作业需要.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 26,
      "unit_hash": "md5:5e46014c9e8e6c8869c4216e55e3a500",
      "num_prefix": "5.1.5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 32,
      "text": "5.1.6　可双向行驶及检测.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 26,
      "unit_hash": "md5:984157abeef6ae526b8c0fd9e2cfeae4",
      "num_prefix": "5.1.6",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 33,
      "text": "5.1.7　应配备保障运行安全的监控装置，如无线列调、机车信号、运行监控装置、轴温报警装置等.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 26,
      "unit_hash": "md5:0107b7da3f3c1aa60d22a64c1305cf6d",
      "num_prefix": "5.1.7",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 34,
      "text": "5.1.8　高海拔钢轨探伤车要求应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中第7章的规定.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 26,
      "unit_hash": "md5:b2292585550701389d52306c4f0aa747",
      "num_prefix": "5.1.8",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 35,
      "text": "5.2　车辆系统(部件)技术要求",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 25,
      "unit_hash": "md5:b86fec0293106434454d23c5f4a2cb04",
      "num_prefix": "5.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 36,
      "text": "5.2.1　动力传动系统",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 35,
      "unit_hash": "md5:f693edf76faebec919eb0003af65233d",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 37,
      "text": "5.2.1.1　应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中6.1的规定.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 36,
      "unit_hash": "md5:a0cfde76693f65c5f7ea807536780a99",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.1.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 38,
      "text": "5.2.1.2　应采用两套动力系统互为备用.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 36,
      "unit_hash": "md5:65ead7c2f2d19d6ea666e1d4c35aa930",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.1.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 39,
      "text": "5.2.1.3　燃油箱的容量应满足连续运行1200ｋｍ或24ｈ的需要，并配备加油泵和易观察的油位显示\n装置.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 36,
      "unit_hash": "md5:79107fb28a141dfc2ca215b660b00d2c",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.1.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 40,
      "text": "5.2.2　走行系统\n应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中6.2的规定.\n犌犅／犜28426-2021",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 35,
      "unit_hash": "md5:14faf67e23f580d79399ea33ce90e1e3",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 41,
      "text": "5.2.3　液压系统和气动系统",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 35,
      "unit_hash": "md5:ce5e7ca3e447d2fc97e67e88ea3d201f",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 42,
      "text": "5.2.3.1　液压系统应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中6.3的规定.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 41,
      "unit_hash": "md5:c58ebfc8d242f02961ec1c7454861bf9",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.3.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 43,
      "text": "5.2.3.2　气动系统应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中6.5的规定.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 41,
      "unit_hash": "md5:7a0616911514b0a5e8931d9d6d0359ac",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.3.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 44,
      "text": "5.2.3.3　气动系统应满足作业装置的作业要求.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 41,
      "unit_hash": "md5:9606810b296faed94cb94479ec7ad2a5",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.3.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 45,
      "text": "5.2.4　空气制动系统\n应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中6.4的规定.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 35,
      "unit_hash": "md5:b7c5667f5f6bb5b18d0ab640887f529b",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 46,
      "text": "5.2.5　电气系统\n应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中6.6的规定.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 35,
      "unit_hash": "md5:783f864bb008f59b7993253a59dd9533",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 47,
      "text": "5.2.6　车体\n应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中6.7的规定.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 35,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e644dbe02dc5bee43d77dc7279559348",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.6",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 48,
      "text": "5.2.7　司机室与探伤操作室",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 35,
      "unit_hash": "md5:f5422110646ad68b709e015a996cedd3",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.7",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 49,
      "text": "5.2.7.1　司机室应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中6.8的规定.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 48,
      "unit_hash": "md5:cf0ec5a2de8dfe4de372df54dbc852fd",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.7.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 50,
      "text": "5.2.7.2　探伤作业时探伤操作室噪声应低于78ｄＢ(Ａ).",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 48,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e5d3a3ac61f53bf29939262f0cc130d3",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.7.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 51,
      "text": "5.2.8　车钩缓冲装置\n应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中6.9的规定.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 35,
      "unit_hash": "md5:ee1a495c17b1046641fe27c1e123cde6",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.8",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 52,
      "text": "5.2.9　照明装置\n应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中6.10的规定.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 35,
      "unit_hash": "md5:0951073ffd35e859d74767dc0578fe77",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.9",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 53,
      "text": "5.2.10　供水装置",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 35,
      "unit_hash": "md5:c278db2f8e4e9b93d2bd29be9df6d910",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.10",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 54,
      "text": "5.2.10.1　应分别设置工作水箱和生活水箱.工作水箱容量不小于2.5ｍ3.生活水箱容量不小于\n1ｍ3.宜设有单向阀门，可将生活用水补充至工作水箱.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 53,
      "unit_hash": "md5:797802c4b3bdc2c6a905f042050aa20d",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.10.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 55,
      "text": "5.2.10.2　水箱和管路应防锈蚀、无渗漏、可清洗，满足车站上水要求，并设有水位显示装置.供水系统\n应满足冬季作业和生活的需要.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 53,
      "unit_hash": "md5:60a426cd76c9a0fdc51ce33caeb41f57",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.10.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 56,
      "text": "5.3　作业装置(部件)要求",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 25,
      "unit_hash": "md5:c7ce8afc502e73b2348a0c7fbb2ba67f",
      "num_prefix": "5.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 57,
      "text": "5.3.1　探头支承机构",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 56,
      "unit_hash": "md5:9714ae5a2c02931eb67884f5507bb9b2",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 58,
      "text": "5.3.1.1　满足最高自行速度、最高检测速度和最高连挂速度下安全运行的需要，检测时能安全通过\n道岔.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 57,
      "unit_hash": "md5:bf9e1fab1c91756a7027456a544f9377",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.1.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 59,
      "text": "5.3.1.2　应设置锁止装置确保收起时入位可靠.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 57,
      "unit_hash": "md5:250cc0b8416ddab3800e0c28aabdbad7",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.1.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 60,
      "text": "5.3.1.3　能通过工作台控制升降及锁定，并设有视频监视设备.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 57,
      "unit_hash": "md5:d548f855605327a64d027c697add8da3",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.1.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 61,
      "text": "5.3.1.4　应具有耦合水、轮缘水喷洒功能，耦合水喷洒应均匀润湿轨面为探头提供良好耦合，轮缘水喷\n洒应能覆盖整个轮缘区域.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 57,
      "unit_hash": "md5:5b98d87e253c218fc9a3fbac5bba59c1",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.1.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 62,
      "text": "5.3.1.5　应具有探头紧急提升功能，支承机构应具备防脱装置.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 57,
      "unit_hash": "md5:2b953db7f1a0b78ecc1b15e9ffa5f756",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.1.5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 63,
      "text": "5.3.2　探头对中系统",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 56,
      "unit_hash": "md5:44fc10591fed75592303cf5ce9866fcf",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 64,
      "text": "5.3.2.1　应具有探头对中调节功能，可手动和自动操作.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 63,
      "unit_hash": "md5:7c680a573a7eb1821f6b8e8302379458",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.2.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 65,
      "text": "5.3.2.2　对于幅值为5ｍｍ的单位阶跃响应，系统动态性能多次平均测量指标应满足：上升时间狋ｒ≤\n犌犅／犜28426-2021100ｍｓ，超调量δ％≤20％，调节时间狋ｓ≤250ｍｓ.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 63,
      "unit_hash": "md5:469398bc5889a683153abf23f63b141e",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.2.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 66,
      "text": "5.3.2.3　对中偏差值的标准差小于或等于4ｍｍ.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 63,
      "unit_hash": "md5:fc20e8d54d4003406d1e01df20d6d1ef",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.2.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 67,
      "text": "5.3.3　超声检测系统",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 56,
      "unit_hash": "md5:73fd6134fa3408062442be25c9cc21f9",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 68,
      "text": "5.3.3.1　检测系统应有同时探测轨头、轨腰及其延伸部位内部缺陷的能力(由轨面入射的超声束无法射\n及的部位除外).",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 67,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e226adf0f446c0c52908d7e7fbf680fd",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.3.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 69,
      "text": "5.3.3.2　在人工伤损区，最高检测速度±3ｋｍ／ｈ下，平均人工伤损检出率不小于85％，平均伤损误报\n率不大于15％.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 67,
      "unit_hash": "md5:b8a62522f1719cab8d109be3bb1e46cf",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.3.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 70,
      "text": "5.3.3.3　应具有超声波Ａ型显示和实时多通道超声拟合及钢轨伤损Ｂ型彩色显示的功能.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 67,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e3eaa7895d13e617f5572ed59b81f126",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.3.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 71,
      "text": "5.3.3.4　应能够进行实时的超声波信号采集、处理、显示和存储，检测数据存储能力不低于100000ｋｍ.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 67,
      "unit_hash": "md5:90e8a367b11373e7b49c568287cc7374",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.3.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 72,
      "text": "5.3.3.5　能够对钢轨伤损及其特征实时自动判别，并有声音报警和Ｂ型显示延时提示功能.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 67,
      "unit_hash": "md5:d9de4304d7499e3c2b6537538f2c66d9",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.3.5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 73,
      "text": "5.3.3.6　具备数据回放分析功能.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 67,
      "unit_hash": "md5:9163a24230e0b0f9d896ca18003da5c5",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.3.6",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 74,
      "text": "5.3.3.7　具有自动和手动修正里程信息的功能.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 67,
      "unit_hash": "md5:ba9af07d07849224d8548f79cb98085b",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.3.7",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 75,
      "text": "5.3.3.8　系统软件(检测软件和回放软件)应为中文显示，界面友好；能够显示出伤损位置及辅助判别结\n果等信息，可编辑和打印中文格式的探伤报告.系统软件应能在常用操作系统下正常使用.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 67,
      "unit_hash": "md5:c6f5c943ecaeccf27b121542bc197c3f",
      "num_prefix": "5.3.3.8",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 76,
      "text": "5.4　安全、报警装置\n应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中6.11的规定.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 25,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e79ef39d10647e9dc18f61899d106d65",
      "num_prefix": "5.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 77,
      "text": "6　检查与试验方法",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:a79b546561d07c66a6b503f1738bf380",
      "num_prefix": "6",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 78,
      "text": "6.1　外观检查\n外观检查应按照ＧＢ／Ｔ25336-2018第5章规定的外观检查方法进行.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 77,
      "unit_hash": "md5:cdcdf47bfc8a2259404d577b510ac291",
      "num_prefix": "6.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 79,
      "text": "6.2　结构检查\n和车体淋雨试验按照ＧＢ／Ｔ25336-2018规定的方法进行.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 77,
      "unit_hash": "md5:8018bb227d78352008acfc0e34f35c21",
      "num_prefix": "6.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 80,
      "text": "6.3　性能检查",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 77,
      "unit_hash": "md5:4c876749dd56c5bc4ead268019d6baef",
      "num_prefix": "6.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 81,
      "text": "6.3.1　车辆性能检查与试验",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 80,
      "unit_hash": "md5:0885310df363473c9b5378dc6a1c3e35",
      "num_prefix": "6.3.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 82,
      "text": "6.3.1.1　柴油机检查、车体静强度试验、走行系统试验、液压系统试验、制动系统试验、气动系统试验、噪\nＧＢ／Ｔ25336-2018规定的方法进行.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 81,
      "unit_hash": "md5:f042341629754b085255368fb81b8d40",
      "num_prefix": "6.3.1.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 83,
      "text": "6.3.1.2　电气系统试验按ＧＢ／Ｔ25336-2018规定的方法进行，并目视和手动操作检查多路视频监视\n器、电源输出接口及各相关控制功能.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 81,
      "unit_hash": "md5:1e55c1b7396a1bb6e9dabeab30bc86ab",
      "num_prefix": "6.3.1.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 84,
      "text": "6.3.2　供水装置性能检查\n采用目视和手动操作的方式，检查工作水箱、生活水箱水位，检查耦合水加热功能.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 80,
      "unit_hash": "md5:87047b3a135b130bec4eba759d5625d3",
      "num_prefix": "6.3.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 85,
      "text": "6.3.3　作业装置性能检查",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 80,
      "unit_hash": "md5:380f396ebd1199a25a6b1ed3632c275f",
      "num_prefix": "6.3.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 86,
      "text": "6.3.3.1　探头支承机构检查\nａ)　目视和手动操作检查探头支承机构升降功能；\n犌犅／犜28426-2021ｂ)　目视和手动操作检查视频监视范围覆盖探头支承机构升降和横移区域；\nｃ)　目视和手动操作检查耦合水喷洒均匀润湿轨面；\nｄ)　目视和手动操作检查轮缘水覆盖整个轮缘区域.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 85,
      "unit_hash": "md5:58a77ec84897b2442b30ea946db024d9",
      "num_prefix": "6.3.3.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 87,
      "text": "6.3.3.2　探头对中系统检查\nａ)　目视和手动操作检查对中调节功能；\nｂ)　车辆静止时，探头提起状态，给对中系统输入一个幅值为5ｍｍ的单位阶跃信号，观察并记录单位阶跃响应曲线，连续测试10次，向内5次，向外5次，记录系统单位阶跃响应的动态性能指标10次平均值：上升时间狋ｒ，超调量δ％，调节时间狋ｓ；\nｃ)　记录人工伤损测试区10次测试对中偏差数据，统计对中偏差值的标准差.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 85,
      "unit_hash": "md5:42022f57b23f9d5d88684f91d01df78d",
      "num_prefix": "6.3.3.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 88,
      "text": "6.4　运行性能试验\n制动距离试验、自运行试验、附挂运行试验和动力学性能试验按照ＧＢ／Ｔ25336-2018规定的方法进行试验.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 77,
      "unit_hash": "md5:b3679a0e1cb9cd4f447995882392e3b5",
      "num_prefix": "6.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 89,
      "text": "6.5　作业性能试验",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 77,
      "unit_hash": "md5:9496482a7a637d0393cc048fc7cc33bc",
      "num_prefix": "6.5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 90,
      "text": "6.5.1　超声检测系统动态试验",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 89,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e68d2984dabb1a8e0600e6fa234ff4bf",
      "num_prefix": "6.5.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 91,
      "text": "6.5.1.1　试验线路须设有人工伤损区，人工伤损区应满足最高检测速度通过的要求，试验线路的两端应\n损的钢轨见附录Ａ，人工伤损轨采用新制60ｋｇ／ｍ钢轨，钢轨表面无锈蚀；引轨应采用同人工伤损轨型号、材质、廓形、表面状态相同的钢轨.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 90,
      "unit_hash": "md5:91a7262c0dea66a0e3d7808efcfff083",
      "num_prefix": "6.5.1.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 92,
      "text": "6.5.1.2　在系统最高检测速度±3ｋｍ／ｈ下，对试验线路的人工伤损进行连续10次检测，统计计算平均\n人工伤损检出率和平均伤损误报率.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 90,
      "unit_hash": "md5:58fc1f330407df5d2b3c4c8bbd56e196",
      "num_prefix": "6.5.1.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 93,
      "text": "6.5.2　探头支承机构通过道岔性能试验\n在检测状态下按系统最高检测速度±3ｋｍ／ｈ，以正常的操作方式通过12号道岔直股一次.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 89,
      "unit_hash": "md5:b5f3a24b2ccf776cc15ce816486cf2a2",
      "num_prefix": "6.5.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 94,
      "text": "6.5.3　探头应急提升试验\n断开电源和气源，手动或使用应急装置将所有探头提升到位一次.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 89,
      "unit_hash": "md5:f1dafde38703196d4e584b6ba8dd1d40",
      "num_prefix": "6.5.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 95,
      "text": "6.6　高海拔探伤车性能\n高海拔探伤车特殊性能检查按照ＧＢ／Ｔ25336-2018的有关规定进行.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 77,
      "unit_hash": "md5:5fafd3e8f3830306f0d19b980277942e",
      "num_prefix": "6.6",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 96,
      "text": "7　检验规则",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:b1d43a7436afdb17df05c53504efa075",
      "num_prefix": "7",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 97,
      "text": "7.1　检验分为型式检验和出厂检验.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 96,
      "unit_hash": "md5:20d2be476cdbfe0765e02b59c7cd5174",
      "num_prefix": "7.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 98,
      "text": "7.2　批量生产的探伤车每台均应进行出厂检验，检查与试验项目按表1中带“Ｓ”符号的项目进行.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 96,
      "unit_hash": "md5:25f22df61750f377ee0438eea011069a",
      "num_prefix": "7.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 99,
      "text": "7.3　符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018中8.2规定的情况时，检查与试验项目按表1中带“Ｔ”符号的项目进行.\n犌犅／犜28426-2021表1　探伤车的检查与试验项目表序号项目检验类别技术要求对应条款检验方法对应条款外观检查ＴＳ5.1.16.1结构检查Ｔ-5.1.1限界检查ＴＳ5.1.1称重检查Ｔ-5.1.1车钩检查ＴＳ5.2.8Ｔ-4.2.3ＴＳ5.1.1Ｔ-5.1.1ＴＳ4.1.46.2性能检验ＴＳ5.2.16.3.1.1Ｔ-5.2.66.3.1.1Ｔ-ＴＳ车轴齿轮箱及轮对台架试验(最高附挂速度的110％的试验)Ｔ-ＴＳ5.2.26.3.1.1\n电气系统试验ＴＳＴＳＴ-Ｔ-Ｔ-功能试验ＴＳＴＳ5.2.56.3.1.2ＴＳ5.2.3ＴＳ5.2.4Ｔ-5.2.2ＴＳ5.2.3噪声检查Ｔ-5.2.7.2ＴＳ5.2.7制冷和取暖效果检查低温-5℃以下及高温35℃以上检查Ｔ-环温25℃及以上和环温25℃及以下检查-Ｓ5.2.76.3.1.1犌犅／犜28426-2021表1　探伤车的检查与试验项目表(续)序号项目检验类别技术要求对应条款检验方法对应条款性能检验Ｔ-5.2.7Ｔ-5.2.96.3.1.1\nＴＳ5.2.106.3.2ＴＳ5.3.1.2、5.3.1.3、5.3.1.46.3.3.1ＴＳ5.46.3.1.1运行性能试验Ｔ-5.1.1ＴＳ5.1.2ＴＳ5.1.2Ｔ-5.1.46.4作业性能试验ＴＳ5.1.3、5.3.36.5.1ＴＳ5.3.26.3.3.2Ｔ-5.3.1.16.5.2ＴＳ5.3.1.56.5.3注：Ｔ---型式检验；Ｓ---出厂检验.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 96,
      "unit_hash": "md5:da16169e415a2726b35a5d53bdc9f871",
      "num_prefix": "7.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 100,
      "text": "8　整机的标志、包装和运输",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:4d08e7fb1f079f0475d39cca857f6427",
      "num_prefix": "8",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 101,
      "text": "8.1　标志\n放”“禁止攀登”等，应符合产品图样及技术文件的规定.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 100,
      "unit_hash": "md5:13a14c664ce4ef08603b52fe79c2ee05",
      "num_prefix": "8.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 102,
      "text": "8.2　包装",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 100,
      "unit_hash": "md5:c411c0e5e2d14fe49b0c4fbe78bfe27a",
      "num_prefix": "8.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 103,
      "text": "8.2.1　应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018的要求.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 102,
      "unit_hash": "md5:3138ee6c665586c0bf0661612281c1f6",
      "num_prefix": "8.2.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 104,
      "text": "8.2.2　探头应从其支承机构上拆除.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 102,
      "unit_hash": "md5:83aa9134efc50afa6feeab11d68d3471",
      "num_prefix": "8.2.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 105,
      "text": "8.2.3　探头支承机构应置于收起位，并捆扎牢固.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 102,
      "unit_hash": "md5:a519b92f8bf17f7fb8191e9d79322cb4",
      "num_prefix": "8.2.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 106,
      "text": "8.2.4　以下部件应进行保护处理：\nａ)　车外部探伤系统的监控摄像头应进行包捆防护；\nｂ)　影响长途附挂回送的螺栓应紧固；\nｃ)　车轴齿轮箱、轴承箱等应按要求的牌号及数量加装润滑油.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 102,
      "unit_hash": "md5:f0bd84262b5a504f564f8c4396a5a1d9",
      "num_prefix": "8.2.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 107,
      "text": "8.3　运输\n应符合ＧＢ／Ｔ25337-2018的规定.\n犌犅／犜28426-2021(资料性)试验线路人工伤损描述见表Ａ.1.试验线路人工伤损轨总体布局见图Ａ.1，左右股对称各铺设4根人工伤损轨和1根引轨，引轨长度宜为25ｍ，单根人工伤损轨长度宜为12.5ｍ.左股人工伤损布局见图Ａ.2，右股人工伤损镜像对称分布.\n表犃.1　试验线路人工伤损描述序数量个／单股描述1轨头平底孔(Ａ01～Ａ08)自顶面斜钻直径4ｍｍ、5ｍｍ、6ｍｍ、7ｍｍ，前后向、内侧、左右股轨头核伤偏斜70°探头，二次波横孔(Ｂ01～Ｂ36)直径3ｍｍ、4ｍｍ、5ｍｍ，轨面下10ｍｍ、12ｍｍ、18ｍｍ，孔长25ｍｍ，轨头核伤内侧或外侧直70°探直径3ｍｍ、4ｍｍ、5ｍｍ，轨面下10ｍｍ、12ｍｍ、18ｍｍ，孔长35ｍｍ，左轨头核伤内中或外中直70°探横通孔(Ｃ01～Ｃ02)直径4ｍｍ，轨面下12ｍｍ，左右股\n轨端伤损前或后内中外直70°2轨颚半圆槽(Ｄ01～Ｄ06)半径4ｍｍ深2ｍｍ、半径5ｍｍ深4ｍｍ、半径6ｍｍ深6ｍｍ，左右股、内外侧轨颚横向裂纹内侧或外侧直70°探3轨腰(Ｅ01～Ｅ28)1Ｂ、1Ｃ、2Ａ、2Ｄ，长度3ｍｍ、5ｍｍ、8ｍｍ，钢轨两端对称、左右股37°探头3孔水平，长度3ｍｍ、5ｍｍ、8ｍｍ，直探头、37°探头横孔(Ｆ01～Ｆ12)4ｍｍ、5ｍｍ、6ｍｍ、7ｍｍ，距踏面56ｍｍ、97ｍｍ、136ｍｍ，左右股焊缝伤损37°探头\n4轨底半圆槽(Ｇ01～Ｇ03)半径4ｍｍ深2ｍｍ、半径5ｍｍ深4ｍｍ、半径6ｍｍ深6ｍｍ，左右股37°探头合计单股95个，双股190个犌犅／犜28426-2021GB/T 28426-2021上 局",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 100,
      "unit_hash": "md5:b6a8d8799728bbe9b77d6ab92b265949",
      "num_prefix": "8.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 108,
